---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Prose — Adam Dolin" description="Short stories and flash fiction by Adam Dolin.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/work" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Work</a>

      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Writing Samples</span>
        <h1>Prose</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">Short stories and flash fiction.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="category-heading">NYC Midnight</h2>
      <p class="category-desc">Written under competition constraints for the NYC Midnight writing challenges. Each piece is written within strict time limits, assigned genres, and mandatory story elements.</p>

      <div class="items-list">
        <a href="/files/suburban-exfiltration.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card item-card">
          <span class="label">2024 &mdash; 250-Word Micro-Fiction</span>
          <h3>Suburban Exfiltration</h3>
          <p>Winning entry for the first round of 2024 NYC Midnight's 250-Word Micro-fiction contest.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span class="tag">Micro-Fiction</span>
            <span class="tag">Round 1 Winner</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-link">Read PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/files/Microfiction%202024%20R2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card item-card">
          <span class="label">2024 &mdash; 250-Word Micro-Fiction</span>
          <h3>The Captive King</h3>
          <p>Aboard the HMS Revolution, Captain Cook's crew grows superstitious after abducting the king of Hawai&#699;i&mdash;while their captive watches the gathering storm with quiet amusement.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span class="tag">Micro-Fiction</span>
            <span class="tag">Round 2</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-link">Read PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/files/250%20words%20-%20December%20-%20I%20wonder.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card item-card">
          <span class="label">2024 &mdash; 250-Word Micro-Fiction</span>
          <h3>I Wonder&hellip;</h3>
          <p>A med student reflects on the childhood trauma of witnessing their grandmother's fatal heart attack in an elevator&mdash;and the haunting question that followed them into adulthood.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span class="tag">Micro-Fiction</span>
            <span class="tag">Horror</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-link">Read PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/files/Rifan%20Plays%20for%20Ahmed's%20Birthday.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card item-card">
          <span class="label">2024 &mdash; 500-Word Micro-Fiction</span>
          <h3>Rifan Plays for Ahmed&rsquo;s Birthday</h3>
          <p>A young girl wants to play the oud for her music teacher on his birthday, but settles for a different audience.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span class="tag">Micro-Fiction</span>
            <span class="tag">Drama</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-link">Read PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/files/The%20Dinner%20Invitation.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card item-card">
          <span class="label">2024 &mdash; Flash Fiction</span>
          <h3>The Dinner Invitation</h3>
          <p>While delivering a hallway violation notice, Lena is unexpectedly invited into the lavish home of a Russian family. But the family's hospitality is overshadowed by a simmering violent tension.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span class="tag">Flash Fiction</span>
            <span class="tag">Thriller</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-link">Read PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .category-heading {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .category-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .items-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .item-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-base);
  }

  .item-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .item-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .item-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .project-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--color-accent-dim);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .project-link {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: auto;
  }
</style>
